<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Agip '96 profit steady.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Agip '96 profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for petroleum marketer Agip Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>					 1996	1995</p>
<p> Turnover			    5,600    5,500</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	  317.6    334.3</p>
<p> Taxation			     92.5    114.2</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	   225.1    220.1</p>
<p> Dividend	     35 kobo per share   30 kobo per share</p>
<p>NOTE: The company is also proposing a bonus share issue of one new share for every 10.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
